    },
    "summary": "Interior of a bright modern property office at midday. EXACTLY THREE PEOPLE are present throughout and the number never changes: a young female cleaner in a navy housekeeping uniform standing still on the near side of a dark wooden desk, a middle-aged male property manager in a white shirt and charcoal waistcoat who strides two paces and slams his palm on the desk, and a young female colleague in a light-grey cleaning uniform standing motionless against the far LEFT corner wall. The left-hand door stays closed and the doorway stays empty — no one enters, no one leaves, no one is duplicated. Venetian-blind light bands fall across the room.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Wide, one continuous camera move, no cut: all three people are ALREADY in the room at the very first frame and all three are visible at once — there is NO entrance, nobody walks in, the door stays shut. 钱经理 (S3) strides the two paces from the far side of the door to the far side of the desk, his charcoal waistcoat swinging and nothing pinned to his chest, and comes to a stop. 苏小满 (S1) does not move at all. 小唐 (S4) does not move at all, she stays against the LEFT corner wall with only her eyes moving. The three of them are the only people in frame.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, medium over the desk: 钱经理 (S3) at the far side plants both feet wide, leans forward on straight arms and slams his open palm flat onto the desktop; the palm lands flat against the bare desk. 苏小满 (S1) holds her ground on the near side, still unmoved. 小唐 (S4) is still in the LEFT corner, unmoved. Three people, no more.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, closer on 钱经理's (S3) flushed face as he announces it in a loud nasal Mandarin, filing each item like a charge sheet: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.400, reverse over the desk onto 苏小满 (S1) on the near side, the blind-light barring the wall behind her: she stands perfectly still, both hands loose at her sides, chin level, eyes on him. Her mouth stays closed and she says nothing. 小唐 (S4) is still a small figure in the LEFT corner. The room is empty apart from these three.",
    "soundscape": "Hard brisk footsteps on the tiled floor, the flat slap of a palm on wood, a chair creaking, the blind slats settling, the buzz of the ceiling fluorescent panels, a wall clock ticking, faint muffled traffic through the blinds.",
    "music": "N/A",
    "anchor": "Fixed spatial set-up for this whole take, never change it and never re-arrange: the door is on the LEFT of frame and it STAYS CLOSED AND EMPTY for the entire take — the doorway is a bare doorframe with nothing standing in it and nobody passing through it. There are EXACTLY THREE PEOPLE in this shot, always the same three, never a fourth: 钱经理 (S3), 苏小满 (S1) and 小唐 (S4). Nobody else is in the room, nobody is in the corridor, no bystanders, no onlookers, no staff. 苏小满 (S1) stands on the NEAR side of the desk on the RIGHT half of frame, back to the door, facing the far side, and she NEVER moves from that spot for the entire take. 钱经理 (S3) enters through the LEFT door ONCE in the first two seconds, then STANDS STILL at the far side of the desk for the rest of the take, and he never walks in again. 小唐 (S4) is ALREADY STANDING STILL in the far LEFT corner of frame when the take begins — she never walks in, she never passes through the door, she just stays pressed against that corner wall, in the LEFT third of frame and clearly separate from the doorframe. No person is duplicated, cloned, split into two, or fades in and out. The number of people never increases and never decreases. Never mirror or swap any of this.",
    "crowd": false,
    "ref_notes": {
      "office_pano": "the property office of 万山大厦 seen empty, used for LAYOUT, FURNITURE and DAYLIGHT reference ONLY. Do NOT copy any person, figure, silhouette or body part that happens to be visible in this picture — the people in this shot come only from <Subject 1>, <Subject 2> and <Subject 3>. The room contains no other human being."
    },
    "style_pack": "lean",
    "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Wide, one continuous camera move, no cut: all three people are ALREADY in the room at the very first frame and all three are visible at once — there is NO entrance, nobody walks in, the door stays shut. 钱经理 (S3) strides the two paces from the far side of the door to the far side of the desk, his charcoal waistcoat swinging and nothing pinned to his chest, and comes to a stop. 苏小满 (S1) does not move at all. 小唐 (S4) does not move at all, she stays against the LEFT corner wall with only her eyes moving. The three of them are the only people in frame.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, medium over the desk: 钱经理 (S3) at the far side plants both feet wide, leans forward on straight arms and slams his open palm flat onto the desktop; the palm lands flat against the bare desk. 苏小满 (S1) holds her ground on the near side, still unmoved. 小唐 (S4) is still in the LEFT corner, unmoved. Three people, no more.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, closer on 钱经理's (S3) flushed face as he announces it in a loud nasal Mandarin, filing each item like a charge sheet: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.400, reverse over the desk onto 苏小满 (S1) on the near side, the blind-light barring the wall behind her: she stands perfectly still, both hands loose at her sides, chin level, eyes on him. Her mouth stays closed and she says nothing. 小唐 (S4) is still a small figure in the LEFT corner. The room is empty apart from these three.",
    "lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Wide, one continuous camera move, no cut: all three people are ALREADY in the room at the very first frame and all three are visible at once — there is NO entrance, nobody walks in, the door stays shut. 钱经理 (S3) strides the two paces from the far side of the door to the far side of the desk, his charcoal waistcoat swinging and nothing pinned to his chest, and comes to a stop. 苏小满 (S1) does not move at all. 小唐 (S4) does not move at all, she stays against the LEFT corner wall with only her eyes moving. The three of them are the only people in frame.\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.000, medium over the desk: 钱经理 (S3) at the far side plants both feet wide, leans forward on straight arms and slams his open palm flat onto the desktop; the palm lands flat against the bare desk. 苏小满 (S1) holds her ground on the near side, still unmoved. 小唐 (S4) is still in the LEFT corner, unmoved. Three people, no more.\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.200, closer on 钱经理's (S3) flushed face as he announces it in a loud nasal Mandarin, filing each item like a charge sheet: [Chinese] 三楼包厢。贵客丢了一只金耳钉。三万八。\n[Shot 4] At 00:08.400, reverse over the desk onto 苏小满 (S1) on the near side, the blind-light barring the wall behind her: she stands perfectly still, both hands loose at her sides, chin level, eyes on him. Her mouth stays closed and she says nothing. 小唐 (S4) is still a small figure in the LEFT corner. The room is empty apart from these three.",
    "lean_anchor": "The walls behind the people are smooth painted plaster of one single light colour, unbroken and continuous from the skirting board up to the ceiling. All cardboard archive boxes and folders are plain brown corrugated cardboard. The people named in this beat are the only people in it and the count does not change."
