  {
    "id": "xs01_t02",
    "scene": "1-1",
    "title": "点名",
    "refs": [
      "qianjingli",
      "suxiaoman",
      "xiaotang"
    ],
    "retention": {
      "qianjingli": "fully_preserved - his slicked-back oily hair, round face and dark grey buttoned waistcoat over a white shirt are retained in every shot.",
      "suxiaoman": "fully_preserved - her centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, dark navy button-up work shirt and worn grey apron are retained in every shot.",
      "xiaotang": "fully_preserved - her hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey work shirt and light-grey apron are retained in every shot."
    },
    "summary": "The manager narrows it down to one person, staring across the desk; she denies it flatly and without heat.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the far side of the desk with the grey filing cabinets directly behind his back, facing the camera, one palm flat on the desk; 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end of that desk with her back to the camera and a plain stretch of white wall behind her, facing him; 小唐 (S4) stands against the back wall at the far left of frame, her shoulder blade on the white paint, waiting where she has been standing.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he straightens up slowly, tucks both hands behind his back and tips his head to one side, fixing 苏小满 (S1) with the look of a man who has already decided. His mouth opens and he speaks in a flat accusing Mandarin, one phrase at a time: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her. She does not move her feet and does not look away, and she answers at once in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 不是我。\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the end of the desk as 钱经理 (S3) finishes the accusation and stops, and his eyes leave her. He turns his head and shoulders away from the desk toward the left-hand wall of the room. 苏小满 (S1) stays where she is at the near end of the desk, following him with her eyes.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on 钱经理 (S3)'s face as he turns his head fully to the left and looks straight at 小唐 (S4) against the wall. The look lasts a beat and says everything. His lips stay closed through it. 小唐 (S4) sees it and pushes off the wall with her shoulder, taking the first step forward into the room.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office as 钱经理 (S3) gives one short jerk of his chin toward the open floor beside the desk. 苏小满 (S1) has gone very still at the near end of the desk, watching the colleague approach. The room is quiet.\n\nFrom [Shot 4] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is 钱经理 (S3) chewing nothing and swallowing; every line of dialogue has already finished by then, and the office falls into room tone. No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "soundscape": "A clock ticking on the wall, the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a sharp intake of breath from 钱经理 at 2.5s before he speaks; one nervous swallow from 小唐 at 8.5s; the soft scrape of a shoe on the floor at 9.0s as she steps forward.",
    "music": "A low sustained string drone begins at 0s and thins to a single held note from 8.5s, ending on a short cello pulse as the colleague steps forward.",
    "crowd": false,
    "style_pack": "lean",
    "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the far side of the desk with the grey filing cabinets directly behind his back, facing the camera, one palm flat on the desk; 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end of that desk with her back to the camera and a plain stretch of white wall behind her, facing him; 小唐 (S4) stands against the back wall at the far left of frame, her shoulder blade on the white paint, waiting where she has been standing.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he straightens up slowly, tucks both hands behind his back and tips his head to one side, fixing 苏小满 (S1) with the look of a man who has already decided. His mouth opens and he speaks in a flat accusing Mandarin, one phrase at a time: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her. She does not move her feet and does not look away, and she answers at once in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 不是我。\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the end of the desk as 钱经理 (S3) finishes the accusation and stops, and his eyes leave her. He turns his head and shoulders away from the desk toward the left-hand wall of the room. 苏小满 (S1) stays where she is at the near end of the desk, following him with her eyes.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on 钱经理 (S3)'s face as he turns his head fully to the left and looks straight at 小唐 (S4) against the wall. The look lasts a beat and says everything. His lips stay closed through it. 小唐 (S4) sees it and pushes off the wall with her shoulder, taking the first step forward into the room.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office as 钱经理 (S3) gives one short jerk of his chin toward the open floor beside the desk. 苏小满 (S1) has gone very still at the near end of the desk, watching the colleague approach. The room is quiet.\n\nFrom [Shot 4] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is 钱经理 (S3) chewing nothing and swallowing; every line of dialogue has already finished by then, and the office falls into room tone. No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.",
    "lean_anchor": "The whole clip takes place in one small private office and the camera never leaves it. The room has four plain white walls, a grey metal filing cabinet along the far wall, a long wooden desk standing across the middle of the floor, venetian blinds on the right-hand wall laying bright bands of light across the desk top and the floor, and a closed wooden door set flat into the back wall with a small silver handle. Bright mid-morning daylight fills the room and every surface reads clearly. The people named in this beat are the only people in it: the manager stays behind the desk on the far side, the cleaner stays at the near end of it with her back to the camera, and the colleague stays against the back wall at the far left of frame. The walls behind the people are smooth painted plaster of one single light colour, unbroken and continuous from the skirting board up to the ceiling. All cardboard archive boxes and folders are plain brown corrugated cardboard.",
    "lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Static Shot, a medium two-shot across the desk: 钱经理 (S3) stands on the far side of the desk with the grey filing cabinets directly behind his back, facing the camera, one palm flat on the desk; 苏小满 (S1) stands at the near end of that desk with her back to the camera and a plain stretch of white wall behind her, facing him; 小唐 (S4) stands against the back wall at the far left of frame, her shoulder blade on the white paint, waiting where she has been standing.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at slow speed, moving in on 钱经理 (S3) as he straightens up slowly, tucks both hands behind his back and tips his head to one side, fixing 苏小满 (S1) with the look of a man who has already decided. His mouth opens and he speaks in a flat accusing Mandarin, one phrase at a time: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, Camera: Truck Right with medium amplitude at slow speed, swinging across the desk to a reverse single on 苏小满 (S1), the blind-laying light barring the wall behind her. She does not move her feet and does not look away, and she answers at once in a low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 不是我。\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, Camera: Arc Shot with medium amplitude at slow speed, curving around the end of the desk as 钱经理 (S3) finishes the accusation and stops, and his eyes leave her. He turns his head and shoulders away from the desk toward the left-hand wall of the room. 苏小满 (S1) stays where she is at the near end of the desk, following him with her eyes.\n\n[Shot 5] At 00:08.500, Camera: Push In with small amplitude at fast speed, closing in on 钱经理 (S3)'s face as he turns his head fully to the left and looks straight at 小唐 (S4) against the wall. The look lasts a beat and says everything. His lips stay closed through it. 小唐 (S4) sees it and pushes off the wall with her shoulder, taking the first step forward into the room.\n\n[Shot 6] At 00:09.400, Camera: Pull Out with large amplitude at slow speed, revealing the whole office as 钱经理 (S3) gives one short jerk of his chin toward the open floor beside the desk. 苏小满 (S1) has gone very still at the near end of the desk, watching the colleague approach. The room is quiet.\n\nFrom [Shot 4] through [Shot 6] the only mouth movement in frame is 钱经理 (S3) chewing nothing and swallowing; every line of dialogue has already finished by then, and the office falls into room tone. No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; use hard cuts only and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks."
  },
  {
    "id": "xs01_t03",
