    "summary": "The cleaner turns the accusation back on the witness; the girl retreats into her own certainty.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 苏小满 (S1) turns her head and shoulders toward the door, fixing 小唐 (S4) with an even, unhurried look, and says it quietly in low steady Mandarin, without raising her voice at all: [Chinese] 小唐。看清楚了，再说。\n[Shot 2] At 00:05.600, close on 小唐 (S4): she shrinks her neck down into her collar, plants one hand on the doorframe behind her, looks anywhere but at the cleaner, and answers in a thin defensive Mandarin: [Chinese] 反正，我看见了。\n[Shot 3] At 00:08.600, wide: 小唐 (S4) stands against the left-hand wall in the near part of the room, 苏小满 (S1) stands at the desk just behind her, and 钱经理 (S3) stands motionless behind the desk with the filing cabinets behind him, watching them like a spectator, arms folded.\n[Shot 4] At 00:09.600, hold. All three of them stay exactly where they are, every mouth closed, the office still.",
