  {
    "id": "xs01_t05",
    "scene": "1-1",
    "title": "掏兜",
    "refs": [
      "qianjingli",
      "suxiaoman"
    ],
    "retention": {
      "office_mid": "partially_preserved",
      "office_pano": "fully_preserved"
    },
    "summary": "He orders her to empty her pockets, offering the alternative of security; she holds her ground and refuses to be searched.",
    "shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) walks two paces around the corner of the desk toward her, stops at the distance of an outstretched arm, taps his own hip pocket twice with two fingers and speaks in a hard flat Mandarin, not loud, not shouting: [Chinese] 掏兜。自己掏，还是我喊保安。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1) filling the frame on her own, the plain office wall and the bright window band behind her, one person in this shot: she takes one small half-step back, and her right hand closes slowly over the fabric of her own trouser pocket; she speaks quietly and clearly in low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.400, close on the pocket under her fingers, the fabric pulled slightly taut, her own hand and the cloth filling the whole frame. She is silent after that.",
    "soundscape": "Tense quiet, his knuckles tapping cloth, a shoe shifting on tile, the fluorescent hum, a low murmur of room tone.",
    "music": "A low sustained synth note, tight and uneasy.",
    "crowd": false,
    "style_pack": "lean",
    "_lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) walks two paces around the corner of the desk toward her, stops at the distance of an outstretched arm, taps his own hip pocket twice with two fingers and speaks in a hard flat Mandarin, not loud, not shouting: [Chinese] 掏兜。自己掏，还是我喊保安。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1) filling the frame on her own, the plain office wall and the bright window band behind her, one person in this shot: she takes one small half-step back, and her right hand closes slowly over the fabric of her own trouser pocket; she speaks quietly and clearly in low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.400, close on the pocket under her fingers, the fabric pulled slightly taut, her own hand and the cloth filling the whole frame. She is silent after that.",
    "lean_anchor": "The whole clip takes place in one small private office and the camera never leaves it. The room has four plain white walls, a grey metal filing cabinet along the far wall, a long wooden desk standing across the middle of the floor, and venetian blinds on the right-hand wall laying bright bands of light across the desk top and the floor. A closed wooden door is set flat into the back wall, its surface plain wood with a small silver handle. Everything in this room reads as an office interior: the desk, the cabinet, the blinds and the plain painted walls. The walls behind the people are smooth painted plaster of one single light colour, unbroken and continuous from the skirting board up to the ceiling. All cardboard archive boxes and folders are plain brown corrugated cardboard. The people named in this beat are the only people in it: the manager stays behind the desk on the far side, the cleaner stays at the near end of it with her back to the camera, and the colleague stands where this beat places her. The count does not change.",
    "lean_shots": "[Shot 1] Medium: 钱经理 (S3) walks two paces around the corner of the desk toward her, stops at the distance of an outstretched arm, taps his own hip pocket twice with two fingers and speaks in a hard flat Mandarin, not loud, not shouting: [Chinese] 掏兜。自己掏，还是我喊保安。\n[Shot 2] At 00:07.200, reverse single on 苏小满 (S1) filling the frame on her own, the plain office wall and the bright window band behind her, one person in this shot: she takes one small half-step back, and her right hand closes slowly over the fabric of her own trouser pocket; she speaks quietly and clearly in low steady Mandarin: [Chinese] 你们不能搜我。\n[Shot 3] At 00:09.400, close on the pocket under her fingers, the fabric pulled slightly taut, her own hand and the cloth filling the whole frame. She is silent after that."
